insert into g_real values (3, '00000000-0000-4000-9000-000000000503', 'length', 764, '{"about_course": true, "sentences": [{"text": "The Graduate Diploma of Information Technology (GDIT) is designed as an embedded qualification within the Master of Information Technology.", "quote": "The Graduate Diploma of Information Technology (GDIT) is designed as an embedded qualification within the Master of Information Technology.", "on_page": true}, {"text": "The course commences by building essential technical knowledge and skills in programming, databases, project management, and information systems, providing students with a strong foundation in core areas of information technology.", "quote": "The course commences by building essential technical knowledge and skills in programming, databases, project management, and information systems, providing students with a strong foundation in core areas of information technology.", "on_page": true}, {"text": "It then progresses to developing broader and more advanced technical capability across key areas including cyber security, data analysis, cloud computing, and systems analysis.", "quote": "It then progresses to developing broader and more advanced technical capability across key areas including cyber security, data analysis, cloud computing, and systems analysis.", "on_page": true}, {"text": "The GDIT prepares graduates for junior to intermediate IT roles and provides a direct pathway into the Master of Information Technology for those wishing to further develop advanced technical and professional skills.", "quote": "The GDIT prepares graduates for junior to intermediate IT roles and provides a direct pathway into the Master of Information Technology for those wishing to further develop advanced technical and professional skills.", "on_page": true}]}'::jsonb);
